=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Guards\" title=\"Guards\">Undead Guard</a> +2:</b> Chance to deal 2d8 Good damage to undead when hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD;\" rowspan=\"5\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Mournlode_Breastplate_(level_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Mournlode_Breastplate_%28level_4%29.png/420px-Mournlode_Breastplate_%28level_4%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"453\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Mournlode_Breastplate_%28level_4%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><a href=\"/page/Vaults_of_the_Artificers\" title=\"Vaults of the Artificers\">Vaults of the Artificers</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Mournlode_Breastplate_(level_8)\" title=\"Item:Mournlode Breastplate (level 8)\">Mournlode Breastplate (level 8)</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\"><i>Metal armor constructed from valuable purple Mournlode crystal is imbued with a protective, almost holy power. Undead are seared by it,and it protects the wearer from evil.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#F0DC82\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFFACD\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817055012\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.105 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.146 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3186/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23970/2097152 bytes\nTe